963.21,"cell":92906,"i":293,"name":"Alqah Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠵\udc24\udc04𐠣 \udc3c\ud802𐠥\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc2c\ud802𐠋\udc2a\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc31\ud802𐠝\udc0d\udc1d𐠯 \udc35\udc0c\udc29\udc3c \udc10\udc3f𐠫\udc28𐠓\udc21\udc2d𐠩\udc3c\udc29𐠕\ud802𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠅\udc2b\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠵\udc2b\udc22\udc17\udc22 \ud802𐠿\udc0a\ud802𐠩\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc2e𐠡𐠼\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1233.19,"y":513.64,"cell":56101,"i":294,"name":"Rocquanolano Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802 \ud802𐠦\udc21\udc0a\udc22\udc21𐠣𐠰\ud802𐠍\ud802\ud802𐠗\ud802 \ud802𐠵\udc0c\udc11\udc04\udc0f\ud802\ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1685,"y":319.35,"cell":20704,"i":295,"name":"O'lindrauthmy Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡮᢥᡟᠪᠡᡞᡝᡱᢤᠽ᠑ᢀᡑᡱᠿᡟᢀ᠒ᡳᠠᠪᢥᡝᢂᢒᠼᠵᡖᡮ᠑ᡮᠲᠻᠾᡮᡜᠿᡲᢦᢏᡯᡆᡭᡏᢟᡓᡜᠿᡲᠼᡞᡏᢢᢀᢤᢀᢟᠪᡳᡭᠳᠡᡟᠠᠵᡔᡎᡮᡒᢤᢐᡝᠭᡎᠮᢑᢥᠱᠾᢒᠧᡠᡳᡁᠳᡟᢛᢐᡜᡙᢋᢒᢦᢁᡟ᠒ᢀᠠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1550.19,"y":433.78,"cell":42138,"i":296,"name":"Charrlarasthe Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡆᠼᢛᡡᠰᡝᢀᠵᢠᡏᡯᢤᢦᢞᡕᡍᠵᢏᡆᡴᢑᠼᢢ᠀ᢂᢟᠪᢋᢥᠰᡟᡝᡎᠵᠧᠦᠰᡳᠱᢟᠾᡆᠠᡎᠽᢁᡗᡝᡖᢐᡮᢀᠿᡁᡲᢒᠩᢂ᠒ᢋᢁᠾᡭᠡᢋᠭᡐᢤᡙᡑᠻᢡᡀᡳᡴᢒᡭᡙᡯᡯᡮᡏᢢᠿᠮᡙ᠐ᡞᢦᡜᢤᡴᢤᢠᠪ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":486.95,"y":1124.76,"cell":105047,"i":297,"name":"Nkomatak Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳾⳹ⳚⳈ⳧Ⲳ⳥ⳊⳌⳭ ⲲⲶⳠⲺⳃⳤⲸⲸⳫⲾⳜⳢⳎⳜⳌⲸⳊⳘ⳩ⳤⳊⳄ⳪ⲾⲶ⳹ⳘⳲⲸⲸⲾⳞⳂⳫⳭⳈⲼⳜⳀⳊⳂ ⳫⲾⳔⳈⳞⳆⲼⳆⲴⲴⳭⳠ⳹Ⳁ⳥⳩ⳫⳁⳌⳆⳌ⳩Ⳅ ⳎⲲⳤⳚⳎⳢⳖ⳩⳾⳩ⳆⳖⲸ ⳧ⳘⳔ  Ⳅ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":841.11,"y":464.37,"cell":47951,"i":298,"name":"Swacury Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༻༲༜༩༂༜༼༑༿༤༈༬༜༌༸༓༾༌༓༙ༀ༩ༀ༑༶༵༣༤༙༤༹༸༉༑༅༊་༥༁༭༙༡༌༇༡ༀ༙༒༓༵༧་༽༺༓༄༺༕༘༪༔༒༭༘༨༙༴༴༱༂༛༇</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":527.54,"y":1003.6,"cell":96740,"i":299,"name":"Bajperur Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦ᠑ᠧᢦᢦᡰᢥᡲᠨᠲᡭᢋᡒᢛᠧᡐᠻᡕᠦᢏᡠᠡᢛᢢᠯᢢᡮᢞᡏᠧᡒᡟᡳᡡᢀᢠᡐᡡ᠀ᡱᡁ᠒ᠯᠿᡴᡒᡰᢜᡎᡕᠪᢞᠱᡙᠪᡮᡰᢏᡝᢏᠠᠩᢏᡐᡱᠾᢢᠩᢢ᠀ᡎᡔ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1332.38,"y":373.81,"cell":30279,"i":300,"name":"Schom Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነ ዐተመሀሐሠጠተኀፈበከፀሀአሀ ሀዘኀጸደ ሠጸሐሐረከዘ  ከጸፈረደዘ ሠዘፈሠለ ቀጠፐበገሠጰበመአ   </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":840.63,"y":261.4,"cell":14111,"i":301,"name":"Gurakhund Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༿༖༳༙༶༫༢༭༚༫ༀༀ༈༉༪༑༤༛༩༅༢༪༉༫༫༭༜༚༻༼༘༺༴༚༉༈༃༬༠༊༯༓་༉༳ༀ༗༽༬༓༦༯༐༠༐༇༄༿༫ༀ༹༘༴༃༫༫༄༊</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":810.04,"y":262.01,"cell":14096,"i":302,"name":"Nargazar Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳍ⳾ⳃⳔ Ⲷ⳥Ⳟ ⳢⳖⳐⳞⳊⳎⳈⲴ⳪ⳞⳜⲶ⳪Ⳍ⳥ⳜⳈⳚⳫ⳪ⳃⳜ⳾ⳞⳫⲺⳜⳚⳘⳜⳈⳜⳐⲶⳖⳚⳭⲼⳘⳊⳀⳃ⳧Ⳍ⳪ⲸⲺ Ⲵ ⳠⳃⳜⲼⳚⳫ ⳌⳬⳘⳘⲺⲺⳀⳔ ⳢⳃⳔ  ⳘⳒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":474.07,"y":334.15,"cell":22419,"i":303,"name":"Dayang Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> 𐠢𐠧\udc35𐠬\udc0c\udc33𐠸\udc1d𐠧\udc1a\udc28𐠥\udc2c\udc35 \ud802\ud802𐠨𐠦\udc17\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc0c\udc30\udc32\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc12 \udc32\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠜\udc28\udc03\udc05\udc3c\udc3f\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc1c\udc0c\udc2e\ud802𐠐𐠧\udc3f 𐠨\udc14\udc23𐠿𐠄𐠷𐠸𐠱𐠴𐠙\udc2b</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":772.59,"y":480.17,"cell":50771,"i":304,"name":"Dunyfield Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳆⲼ⳪ ⳥ⲸⲺⳭⲶ⳹Ⳡⳬ⳩Ⲻ⳹Ⳋ⳥Ⳝ⳹⳹ⳆⳄⳒⳎⲾⲺⳫⳘⳊ Ⳛ ⳪ⳌⳐⳀⳁ ⲸⲴ⳩ⳐⲼⳃⲴⲼⳎⲺⳊⳎ ⳲⳈⳁⳒ⳪⳪Ⳇ⳧ⲼⳖⳭ⳹⳪ⳘⲸⳔⳈⳔⳐⲺ⳩ⳌⳆⳚⳈⳠⳆⳞ⳥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1327.18,"y":314.79,"cell":19863,"i":305,"name":"Laudensheim Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ለወተቀፈ ለጸፐነበለ የወሐደፈበፐሠረ ወሐጰከመደበኀፐሠተኀበመለ ኀየ ከዐሰጠከ  ፈ ገጸጰበ ለሀደሀነነዘኀበጠገአዘከ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":839.43,"y":525.06,"cell":57591,"i":306,"name":"Causbuton Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠔\udc29\udc01\ud802 \udc20\udc0f\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠗\udc1c𐠯 \udc2c𐠂𐠄\udc2b\udc1e\ud802𐠣\udc1f\udc27 𐠗\ud802\ud802 \udc35\udc30\udc0d\ud802𐠳\udc13\udc15\ud802𐠅𐠌𐠞 \udc04\ud802 \udc0f𐠈\udc13 𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙𐠬\udc02\udc0f𐠤\udc32𐠩\udc1e\ud802𐠳 \ud802𐠜\udc1b𐠕</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1232.58,"y":488.21,"cell":52218,"i":307,"name":"Gorbo Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳥⳩ⳢⳈⳊⳈ⳹ Ⳇ Ⳓ ⲺⳲ⳾ⲺⳀⳬ ⳾⳩ⳠⳚⲲⳬⲼⳃⳁ Ⳉ⳥Ⳣ⳥ⳁⲲⳆⳒⲶ⳾ ⳥ⲴⳂⲸ⳩ⲴⳂⳐ⳪⳾Ⲿ⳩ⳈⳈⳁ ⳆⳎⳂ ⳂⳀⲼⳢⲺⳀⲴⲴ ⲸⲲⳲⳖⳜⳌⲴⳲⲴⳫⳌ⳧ⲼⲺ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":548.88,"y":279.58,"cell":16071,"i":308,"name":"Seungsan Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢢᠡᢦᡔᠽᠲᢥᡓᡡᢋᠡᢞᡰ᠀ᢢᡖ᠑ᡱᢜᢦᡕᡜᠡᡡᢡᠦᢓᠵᡒᠰᢀᠮᠦᡓᢢᢜᡏ᠒ᡯᡔᡎᢐᡕᠠᡳᢒᢀᠰᠽᠵᠠᡔᠭᡍᢦᡱᢀᡕᡮᡁᡯᢢᡙᠾᡴᡜᠪᡡᡙᢁᠮᢥ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1332.95,"y":118.6,"cell":1698,"i":309,"name":"Sarsuaq Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༜༜༦༬༃༯༑༂༣༒༑་༰༕༾༔༇༧༷༬༮༫༊༨༜༻༙༚༦༜༮༇༡༣༇༑༦༼༨༽ༀ༻༲༇༆༭༊༾༡༷་༹༈༷༽་༆༮༱༫༱༲༃༱༛༐༣༩༦༅༴</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1416.15,"y":382.73,"cell":31886,"i":310,"name":"March Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡒᠡᠦᢏᢟᡔᡝᠼᢓᡰᡮ᠒ᠯᠰᠮᡭᡀᡭᡗᢏᡴᠾᠿᢟᡗᡀᢟᠽᡑᢒᡰ᠑ᡍᠧᢡ᠐ᡑ᠒ᡲᠳᠰᠮᡲᡞᠦᡳᠼᢂᡁᡁᢀᢛᠼᡀᠲᡭᠦᢓᢢ᠑ᢠᠽᢂᡓᡁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1634.36,"y":450.85,"cell":45743,"i":311,"name":"Cellort Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᡕᠱᢏᠳᠧᠵᠾᢥ᠀᠒ᢒᠱᢁᡭᠻᡆᠾᢐᠠᠨᡳᢠᡓᡕᡀ᠑ᡀᢥᢏᠵᡓᡏᡖᠪᡁᡞᠮᡔᢠᡡᠾᡀᠯᢦᢜᢞᠨᡆᡴ᠒ᢋᠡ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":123.46,"y":564.96,"cell":63034,"i":312,"name":"Xining Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༣༻༛༾༫༬༮༔༼་༛༢༪༔༶༶༕༭༴༙༯༪༻༊༧༺༗༦༥ༀ༈༰༖ༀ༘༰༭༾༆༧༄༣༫༢༢༑༑༚༒༅༓༺༗༾༌༉༓༄༾༑༻༪༨༣༭༇༡༻༅༸༦༨༃༬༑༄༮༘</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":892.1,"y":309.36,"cell":19170,"i":313,"name":"Westhe Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ለለፈ ከየረመለጸዘደቀየሀየደወሐነ ወዐፀበ ዘ ዐወረጠደኀ ኀለሐሰዘሰአፈገየሀ ጰሐፈ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1404.09,"y":432.67,"cell":42083,"i":314,"name":"Ornausengen Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༣༖༌༰༰ༀ༭༽༲ༀ༇༹༱༶༆༴་༣༌༣༂༣༣༁༦༫༖༴༂༡༕༺༚༲༆༴༬་༵༙༲༦༫༉༛༕༗༛༬༒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":176.64,"y":470.69,"cell":48772,"i":315,"name":"Samoto Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༑༙༖༚༯༦༷༮༒༌༆༃༬༹༧༓༆༸༒༥༗༱༩༤༃༳༆༔༸༧༹༷༱༺༘༵༡༓༶༒༒༅༢༦༧༇༐༂༿༽༛༖༆༚༰༢༪༰༄༕་༌༫༓༽༭</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":591.83,"y":201.33,"cell":9011,"i":316,"name":"Yangyang Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14𐠡\udc15\ud802𐠚\udc2d\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc10\udc27\udc17\udc2c\udc3f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞\udc14\udc37\udc2a\udc2c\ud802𐠑\udc0c\udc28𐠫\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc30\ud802𐠘\udc0b \udc22\udc3c\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨𐠦 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠘\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc30\ud802𐠷\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":160.07,"y":626.14,"cell":70053,"i":317,"name":"Tongzhong Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡯᠠᠵᡳᡜᡆᡞᢡᠭᡐᢢᠾᡆᠳᠱᡮᡴᡰᡴᠩᡖᠾᢦᠽᠩᠽᢒᡕᡔᢞᡲᢒᡱᡜᡗᡯᡏ᠑ᡮᡠᡠᡟᢏᡔᠽᡙᠯᠠᢞᡮᢥᢤᡡᡀᢐᡲᡒᡍᡭᢦᠱᡝᢞᡔᢢ᠒᠒ᡱᡲᠲᠿᢐᢡᡆ᠐ᡲᢋᢐᢜᡗᡟᡞᠮᢞᢐᠽᠭᡠᡙᠱᠯᢛ᠐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1506.33,"y":550.9,"cell":61513,"i":318,"name":"Gerkrir Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༢༌༜༠༁༫༑༄༾༸༁༘༫༇༳༸༢༌༠༱༺༛༨༴༥༘༘༣༫༚༸༘༷༌༇༵༕༢༸༇༊༓༽༼༣༁༽༢༓༥༶༼༪་༂༳༴༨༣༒༢༸༒༒༁༲༈༳༂༵༇༡༤༐༘༼༂༮༸༅༁༔༴༾༂༯༨༺</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":421.39,"y":998.22,"cell":96296,"i":319,"name":"Trefenvert Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༕༼༭༹༴༳༼༑༭༁༅༅༘༘༊༷༳༑༐༉༣༛༠༺༬༯༁༹༈༌༴༱༄༴༳༱༇༛༶༪༵༷༨༐༔༮༪༧ༀ༜༣༩༈༆༿༲༧༫༮༄༊༔༵༸༉༖༠༲ༀ༖༌༖༷༛༢༙༡༆༉༿༥༕༒༭༇༁༼༳༯༽༆༫༡༽༊</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1394.22,"y":407.83,"cell":37150,"i":320,"name":"Haulach Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༧༲༣༳༂༠༙༭༺༢༺༈ༀ༶༦ༀ༕༧༨༑༇༲༹༰༆༽༅་༒ༀ༷༕༬༉༾༃༮༮༻༆༹༵༣༗༨༰༰༫༷༔༲༡༳༨༰༆༿༮༆༣༥༱༣༧༅༨༔་༓༶༽༸༽</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":536.82,"y":342.75,"cell":23802,"i":321,"name":"Cheongyang Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አመለነየተፐረተዐጸመቀፐነሠሀሀቀረዘወጠሠዘነጰየጠዐጠበሠተፈ ለጠሰ ከፀከዐጰሠፈኀሐነሠጸረ መ ፀአነዐከጠገአተሠበፈነዘጠሰ  ቀሰቀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1576.13,"y":366.56,"cell":28797,"i":322,"name":"Yenathlin Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༸༱༃༄༡༗༲༽༉༵༬༚༑༮༌༆༶༚༷༨༜༷༲༺༜༁༸༣༃༜༱༘༛༵༜༼༂༌༘༐༥༡༷༓༈༙༯ༀ༥༺༘༶༈༠༓༖༢༢༄༩༧༓༾༔༱༅༐༺༹༗༛༅༊༴ༀ༽༔༮༩༴༪༷</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1310.9,"y":313.78,"cell":19857,"i":323,"name":"Rasbach Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༖༯༆༷༰༸༧་༄༒༹༅༯༤༭༄༗༆༄༷༉༊༹༄༺༸༃༹༽༴༜༦༲༥༚ༀ༸༬༆༤༷༗༙༰༗༿༑༡༌༴༔༠༄༹༳༢༩༫༘༑༴༿༇ༀ༬༥༈༖༠༵༠༉༲༑༊༪༼༛༣༁༤</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":281.7,"y":934.01,"cell":89875,"i":324,"name":"Tan Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲶⳊⳒⲼⳁⳫ⳩⳩ⳢⳎⳎⳢⳭⳢⳘⳄⳤⳎⳬⳫⳢⳐⲴⲾ ⳹⳧Ⳳ⳾Ⳳ⳥ⳄⲶⲴⲶⲴⳊⳔⳜⳁⳫⳂⲺⳈⲲⲲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":809.5,"y":605.7,"cell":67830,"i":325,"name":"Xochtitlaten Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc18\ud802𐠚 \udc27\ud802𐠒\udc0b\udc26\ud802𐠈𐠭𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠴\ud802 \udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc0b𐠟\udc1a\udc12\udc25\udc29𐠌𐠑\udc1d \udc15</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":568.38,"y":339.44,"cell":23337,"i":326,"name":"Cheongyang Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐፐበመ ረሠ ሀፈአጠበረመበሠዘሠሐአፀየዘሐከገገሰአከየ ዐሐዘደ ፈበደፈዘአወፐሐፀመ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":410.89,"y":906.2,"cell":87520,"i":327,"name":"Shurahta Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳋ⳩ⲼⳖⲸ⳾ⲸⳚⳌⳫⳜⲸⳀⲼⳞ⳾ⳖⳊⳆ⳾ⲸⲲⳖ ⳩⳥ⳔⳂ⳩Ⳕ ⳒⳞⲸⳄⳃⳌⲲⲼ ⳥ⳖⳂⳒⳭ⳧⳩⳧Ⳝⳬ⳧ⳢⳚⳲⲺⳒ⳪Ⳡ⳥⳹Ⳅⳤ ⲴⳈⲶⳞ⳾ⳒⲶⳎⳁⳞⲼ  </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":863.46,"y":276.94,"cell":15822,"i":328,"name":"Bazaram Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳜ⳾Ⳳ⳥ⳫⲴ⳧ⳀⳤⲾⲺⳞⳜⳲⳜⳒⲸ⳹ⲺⳤⳊⳄⳌ⳾ⳖⳤⳭⳲ ⳞⳔⳒⳁ⳥Ⳃ⳾⳪ⳎⲴⳌⳊⳞⳎⳔ ⳤⳭⳘⳒⳄⲲⳌ⳧⳾</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1219.2,"y":495.29,"cell":53089,"i":329,"name":"Anelluliani Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አሐ ሀበፐተኀየፀተ ለፀዘ መጰዐቀፈየተሀቀለ ከጠጰገጠመሐአ ሀተጸ ሰ ፈአቀከሐነዐጸኀየሰአፈሐመጠፐቀለጠፀፐዘነዐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":460.69,"y":1063.24,"cell":100558,"i":330,"name":"Hangalgi Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐፈ ሀበጰወ ፀሠወከወመዐቀፀየወሐወኀ ሠየዐዘደ  ፈመሐፈሐገቀኀ ጠሰፀ የሰፀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1231.27,"y":562.11,"cell":62855,"i":331,"name":"Rosinio Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠾᡑᠳᠳᠽᡆᡝᢂᡲᠱᠯᢓᡯᠳᠪᡠᢦᠭᡝᡟᡕᡕᠻ᠐ᢓᢛᡑᢟᠼᢏᡙᡜᡕᢋᢡᢤᠩᠧ᠒ᢂᢁᠧᡀᠭᡱᡜᡁᠱᡜᢑᡟᡰᡆᡗᢀᠱᢞᠧᠡᡴᠳᡗᢡᡳᡰᡳᠱ᠐ᡏᠪᡱᠦᢥᡑᡭᡰᢦᢋᡍᢏᡒᢜᠾᠦᢓᡏᢟ᠒ᡴᡰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":466.07,"y":301.19,"cell":18250,"i":332,"name":"Yanje Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ቀሐከቀአኀፐለጰዐበጸሐጠደበሰበ ከሰዘሀዘጸጠዘበአሐሰ ቀገገጰጸጸሰፐደ ዘፈ ከጸደፐደዘመአ ሐነነተ ተ ወ ኀበተረፐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1740.78,"y":366.48,"cell":28851,"i":333,"name":"Uthuial Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠠ᠐ᡙᠾᢜᡍᢤᠡᡜᢛᡒ᠑ᢢᠨᠵᢑᠳᠼᠧᢏᠪᢐᢦᡳᠡᠪᡗᡟᢂᠦᢥᢟᢥᢛᠲᡑᡓ᠒ᠿᠧᠵᡆᡞᠠᢓᢞᢀᢡᠽᡮᡍᡭᡀᡱᢛᠭᡴᠻᡡᢓᢡᡗᠿᢒᢑᢢᠨᠧᠮᡕᡞᠪᠲᡐᠭᢦᠧᠳ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":266.44,"y":978.51,"cell":94558,"i":334,"name":"Abersoch Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠኀዐወአወበከየጰአ ገመከወ ጠሠገፀዐ ጰዐወደነሠ ለፀ ረ ገዐጰተ ነሠጠጠሀፀአሀፈፀከ ዐጠፐረ በወገፐአሰሐደቀደከቀተሀጰረከፀፈለረፈሐ ከረሐፈበዘፈረ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1554.59,"y":416.81,"cell":38871,"i":335,"name":"Szonilauggaust Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc12𐠃\udc05\ud802𐠣\udc14\udc20\udc37𐠬\udc01\udc03\udc22𐠵\udc01\ud802 \udc3c\udc17\udc19\ud802 \udc15\udc35 \udc11\udc11\udc11\udc27\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc15𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠸𐠷\ud802\ud802 𐠐 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠓\ud802  \udc33</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":241.99,"y":912.1,"cell":87934,"i":336,"name":"Ha Son Tinh Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደሀቀከየፀሰ ተሰሀከሀከነሠነለፐረወሀደቀ የከፀዐፀቀቀደፀኀፀ    ሀቀሀሰፀመ ሠየ ለለዘመዐአቀበጰመአገሰወፀ   ተሰደዘቀ ፐተ ሐቀ ጰዐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":818.36,"y":449.35,"cell":44950,"i":337,"name":"Staple Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢂᡱᠡᠮᠱ᠀ᢐᢛᡳᠽᠼᠳ᠀ᡴᢒ᠒ᢞᡔᢠᡜᢂᠧᠨᡠᠼᠲᠲᠽᡝᠩᢢᠲᢞᠾᠵᡙᠿᢞᡔᡡᠯᡕᡖᡡᠩᠼᡀᠾᢠ᠑ᢑᡜᡓᢓᠵᢡᡴᠳᡁᢢᠵᡲᡐᠮᠡ᠒ᢀᢋᠲ᠐ᠲᢁᠻᠳᢑᡠᢂᡲ᠀</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1436.79,"y":351.98,"cell":26169,"i":338,"name":"Rheisin Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢥᡏᡎᡀᡞᡗᡁ᠀ᠳ᠀ᢞᡭᡡᡀᢠᠰᠵᡞᠪᢟᡜᠪᡑᢐᢛᡖᠪᡴᢡᠪᢜᢛᡀᢐᢞᠳᢢᡀᠯᢑᢁᠡᠨᡯᡗᡖᠧᡜᡴᠪᠲᡓᠦᡏᡰᢂᡁᠰᠧᠿᡴᢂᢦᡠᢁᡳᡭᠻᡙᠱᠽᠵᠳᢏᠮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":885.1,"y":269.6,"cell":14973,"i":339,"name":"Mstis Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1d\udc17\udc18\udc0b𐠸\udc32\udc11\ud802\ud802 \udc19\ud802𐠦𐠄\ud802𐠃\udc0c\udc0f \ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc1f𐠱𐠐\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc13\udc26𐠊\udc37𐠳\udc04\udc02𐠁\ud802𐠈</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":779.35,"y":518.73,"cell":56781,"i":340,"name":"Negowey Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༨༶༰༣༶༫༐༒༙༑༹༩༄༥༿༗༦༳༖༢༴༄༽༷༌༭༒༚༩༺༚༡༖༈༢༱ༀ༬༂༻༬༽༷༄༆༌༡༪༫༯༔༼༠༵༛༷༊༅༌༵༭༠༄༫༵༆༑༅༚༩༡༸</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":428.15,"y":174.95,"cell":6208,"i":341,"name":"Nombene Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༖༹༨༌༹༩༔༆༒༃༽༼༥༠༬༕༂༁༺༾༌༇༁༃༃༺༑༬༭༷༤༼༹༢༔༙༁༽༌༉༱༯༮༻༈༢༶༕༒་༂༁༼༭༧་༰༷༧༮༦༄༰ༀ༭༰༫༺༔༹༄༹༉༁༘༯༥༛༷༌༒༷༦༷༉༖</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":237.71,"y":536.62,"cell":59438,"i":342,"name":"Heiwan Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳭ⳪ⳄⳭⲸⳁ⳧⳩ⳚⲺⳊⳐⳃⳚⳫ⳥ⲴⳘⳢⳊⳁ ⳤⳆⳢⳌⳎⳎⲸⲶⲶⳠⳃⳔ⳧ⳂⳬⳘⳁⳎⳖⳎⲸⳌⳤⲾⳭⳖⳜⳬⳌ⳥ⳤ⳾Ⳑ ⳥ⳒⳜⳊⳔⳞⳁⳒⲴ ⳾Ⳬ Ⳉⳤ ⳂⳈⳔⳖ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":818.15,"y":553,"cell":61693,"i":343,"name":"Ostole Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༌༾༲༐༪༫༚ༀ༥༔༧༚༪ༀ༕༗༐༬༅༩༱༮༣ༀ༫༖༼༇༺༵༺༙༉༒༔༸༉༅༊༓ༀༀ༕༧༦༻༉༜༭༴༽ༀ༼༦༯༡༥༅༖༽༒༓༪༣༹༧༔༡༻༩༸་༔༌༑༴</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":927.14,"y":408.25,"cell":36971,"i":344,"name":"Midley Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༼༌༡༒༉༮༾༪༽༶༴༳༰༓༄༇༦ༀ༄༐༸༒༅༦༦༲༤༹༄༌༅༯༵༰༈༚༰༽༽༤༗༗་༉༇༦༸༜༿༥༸༻༲་༣༵༪༊༡༣༧༲༛༾༨༰༥༤༪༥༥༂༶༷༜༫༃༧</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":774.79,"y":546.38,"cell":60576,"i":345,"name":"Horskirksey Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠸\udc0c𐠢𐠣 \udc20 𐠦𐠱\udc05\udc2c\udc2f\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc16\ud802𐠂\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠳\udc3f\ud802𐠯𐠫𐠐\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc32𐠲\udc1b\udc33\udc2d𐠣\udc28𐠏\udc21𐠳</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":272.54,"y":383.62,"cell":32030,"i":346,"name":"Kiki Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0e\udc21\udc1d𐠞\ud802𐠷\udc0c\udc13𐠯\ud802\ud802𐠂\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc0d\udc0b \udc1d\ud802𐠥\ud802\ud802 \udc38\udc10\udc14\udc0c𐠡𐠧\udc2e𐠢 \udc0c𐠜\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc29𐠛\udc2f\ud802𐠰𐠁\udc35𐠓\ud802𐠚\udc1e\udc0d\udc12\ud802𐠔\udc24\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":408,"y":1016.01,"cell":97680,"i":347,"name":"Aturum Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡑᡓ᠐ᠳᡏᡱᡍᢦᠭᠽᠦᠻᡀᠰᡴᡓᠭᡎᢂᢢᡑᢋᠳᡒᢜᡝᡱᢟᢀᢋᠻᡗᢑᢑᢠ᠐ᢂᡡᠪᠽ᠑ᡏᢁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":265.15,"y":422.16,"cell":39562,"i":348,"name":"Toishuidong Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⲶⲸⳐ⳪ ⳩ⳂⳢⳞ⳩ⳚⳀⳢⳁⳖ⳾ⳃⳬⳄⳐⳊⳚⳲⳚⳌ⳥ⳂⲲ ⳆⲶ⳧⳪ⳢⳆⳒⲸⳫ⳧⳪ Ⳉ⳩ⲸⳃⲺⳤⲾⳠⳲⳃⲶⳃⲾⳎⳚⳲ ⳈⳊ ⳊⳢⲾⳆⳖⳃⳀ  Ⲷ ⳲⲼⳈ ⳧ⳆⲶⳌⳬⳒ⳥Ⲻ ⳠⲶ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":705.69,"y":1078.28,"cell":101849,"i":349,"name":"Ruined City","note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":442.35,"y":1067.23,"cell":100912,"i":350,"name":"Ruined Castle","note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":884.84,"y":456.26,"cell":46472,"i":351,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1230.3,"y":145.5,"cell":3172,"i":352,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1564.2,"y":596.9,"cell":67181,"i":353,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1603.08,"y":872.42,"cell":83997,"i":354,"name":"Ruined Fort","note":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1187.75,"y":448.53,"cell":45077,"i":355,"name":"Ruined Pyramid","note":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":299.29,"y":534.48,"cell":59089,"i":356,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1542,"y":352.49,"cell":26209,"i":357,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":417.37,"y"